### Clear crawler state
DELETE http://localhost:8081/crawler/state


### Start crawler
POST http://localhost:8081/crawler/start?seedUrl=http://host.docker.internal:9000/page1.html


### Check crawler status
GET http://localhost:8081/crawler/status


### Get visited URLs
GET http://localhost:8081/crawler/visited


### Get discovered URLs
GET http://localhost:8081/crawler/discovered


### Health check
GET http://localhost:8081/crawler/health